  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: 'Your first outing as a fake couple is a walk across the yard. Liam stays three feet away from you the entire time.'
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
