  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: 'Over by the field a soccer ball rolls to a stop. Archer is standing there, frozen, staring at the two of you.'
